  "request": {
    "spec": "Change owner deletion to a soft-delete. DELETE /api/owners/{id} must now mark the owner deleted rather than removing the record: it sets 'deleted' true, retains the row, and returns 2xx; GET /api/owners/{id} still returns the owner afterwards with 'deleted' true. A newly created owner has 'deleted' false. The create endpoint's duplicate and identity checks must then ignore owners flagged deleted, so a normally-blocking duplicate is allowed when the only matching owner has been deleted.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nChange owner deletion to a soft-delete. DELETE /api/owners/{id} must now mark the owner deleted rather than removing the record: it sets 'deleted' true, retains the row, and returns 2xx; GET /api/owners/{id} still returns the owner afterwards with 'deleted' true. A newly created owner has 'deleted' false. The create endpoint's duplicate and identity checks must then ignore owners flagged deleted, so a normally-blocking duplicate is allowed when the only matching owner has been deleted.\n"
  },
